        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>American Mortise Lock Sapporo Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAmerican style entry door leverset withSapporo  stainless steel door levers and 2 inch round roses. <b> American Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy duty for residential, commercial and multifamily housing. Entry door lock function uses American mortise cylinder with Schlage C keyway. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI Mortise Set with 104 Lever ad 200 Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Grade: ANSI Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Listing: UL Listed 3 hour</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-9/16\" (141 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Dimeter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub to Cylinder:  87 mm</li>\r\n<li>Hub to Thumbturn: 57 mm</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 30mm × 13mm × 25mm</li>\r\n<li>Latch bolt: 15mm × 17mm</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate 124 x 32 x 2mm</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 70mm (2-3/4\")</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plates: 55mm (2-7/16\") Square </li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Thickness: 11mm (7/16\")</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>AA1756 Office Function:</b> Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Toggle action locking inside. Turning inside lever unlocks outside.</li>\r\n<li><b>AA1724 Storeroom Function:</b> Latch bolt is operated by a lever from either side. The deadbolt is operated by a key from the outside and a turn-piece from the inside. A turn of inside lever retract latch and deadbolt for emergency egress, automatically unlocking outside lever. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold as a set, (for 1 door). Set includes two (2) door levers with 55mm square roses, American mortise cylinder with 55mm square roses, mortise lock case, face plate, strike plate, spindles and installation screws. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
