                "description": "American style entry door leverset withSapporo  stainless steel door levers and 2-7/16 inch round roses. <b> American Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy duty for residential, commercial and multifamily housing. Entry door lock function uses American mortise cylinder with Schlage C keyway.",
